{
  "description": "The host's profile rules (ProfileStore; Pad's input protocol v2, App profiles). Each scenario starts from an empty store at revision 0 over 'presets': \"builtin\" (crates/streamcore-input/presets) or the listed files in ./presets. Steps run in order. forApp (resolve): the profile in effect for an app key: the user's profile whose appKey or alias matches, else a preset that matches, else the user's '*', else the '*' preset; keys compare case-insensitively and a Windows path reduces to its executable name; 'expect' is a subset of that profile (name, preset) or null. upsert: last writer wins by updatedAt. Against stored profiles that share a key or alias, only a strictly newer profile replaces them (an identical one is accepted without a change); when none is stored, only a profile newer than the matching preset is stored, so an unedited preset copy is not (presets are dated 2000-01-01, migrated profiles 2000-01-02). A profile failing validation (schema, blank appKey, updatedAt that is not RFC 3339, keys, modifiers) is 'invalid'. 'expect': result accepted|stale|invalid, 'changed' (stored, revision bumped, broadcast), the revision after it, and what the reply carries: the profile 'name' now in effect for that app key (the stored profile or its preset) or 'deleted' (the app key) when neither exists. upsertPreset: upsert of an unchanged built-in preset by id. delete: removes the user's profiles for the key; 'removed', revision, 'revealedPreset' (id of the preset that applies again, else null), 'sendSnapshot' (true when a preset came back: follow with a fresh profilesSnapshot) and the reply as for upsert. import (importIfMissing): stores each profile for an app with no user profile, by the upsert rules; 'names' of the profiles stored, in order. snapshot: revision and the profiles in effect: the user's (in order) then every preset with at least one key no user profile covers ('names' exact, or 'count'). 'storedNames': the user's profiles after the last step. 'source' says which set a scenario came from.",
  "scenarios": [
    {"name": "lookup order: user, preset by alias, then any-app", "presets": ["sample-krita.json"], "source": "PadWin", "steps": [{"op": "forApp", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"preset": "sample-krita"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "org.krita", "expect": {"preset": "sample-krita"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "notepad.exe", "expect": null}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "*", "name": "Everything", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Everything"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "notepad.exe", "expect": {"name": "Everything"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"preset": "sample-krita"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "krita.exe", "name": "Mine", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 2, "name": "Mine"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "KRITA.EXE", "expect": {"name": "Mine"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "org.krita", "expect": {"preset": "sample-krita"}, "note": "the preset still applies to the key the user's profile does not cover"}]},
    {"name": "first profile for an app is imported when newer than the preset", "presets": ["sample-krita.json"], "source": "PadWin", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "From iCloud", "updatedAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "From iCloud"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "org.krita", "expect": {"name": "From iCloud"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"preset": "sample-krita"}, "note": "org.krita alone does not cover the preset's krita.exe"}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 1, "names": ["From iCloud", "Krita"]}}]},
    {"name": "last writer wins by updatedAt, across time zones", "presets": [], "source": "PadWin", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "app.exe", "name": "first", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "first"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "app.exe", "name": "second", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:01Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 2, "name": "second"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "APP.EXE", "name": "stale", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T12:00:00+02:00", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 2, "name": "second"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "app.exe", "expect": {"name": "second"}}]},
    {"name": "the same profile again does not bump the revision; invalid ones change nothing", "presets": [], "source": "PadWin", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "app.exe", "name": "A", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "A"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "app.exe", "name": "A", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": false, "revision": 1, "name": "A"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "", "name": "bad", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "invalid", "changed": false, "revision": 1, "deleted": ""}}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 1, "names": ["A"]}}]},
    {"name": "a user profile hides the preset only for its keys; deleting it brings the preset back", "presets": ["sample-krita.json"], "source": "PadWin", "steps": [{"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 0, "names": ["Krita"]}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "krita.exe", "name": "Mine", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Mine"}}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 1, "names": ["Mine", "Krita"]}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 2, "revealedPreset": "sample-krita", "sendSnapshot": true, "name": "Krita"}}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 2, "names": ["Krita"]}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"removed": false, "revision": 2, "revealedPreset": null, "sendSnapshot": false, "name": "Krita"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "other.exe", "name": "Other", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 3, "name": "Other"}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "other.exe", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 4, "revealedPreset": null, "sendSnapshot": false, "deleted": "other.exe"}}]},
    {"name": "a profile made from a preset inherits its keys and covers the app on both computers", "presets": ["sample-krita.json"], "source": "core", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "aliases": ["krita.exe"], "name": "Krita (edited)", "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T10:00:00Z", "groups": [], "preset": "sample-krita"}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Krita (edited)"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "krita.exe", "expect": {"name": "Krita (edited)"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "ORG.KRITA", "expect": {"name": "Krita (edited)"}}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 1, "names": ["Krita (edited)"]}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "krita.exe", "aliases": ["org.krita"], "name": "From the PC", "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T09:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 2, "name": "From the PC"}}, {"op": "snapshot", "expect": {"revision": 2, "names": ["From the PC"]}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "org.krita", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 3, "revealedPreset": "sample-krita", "sendSnapshot": true, "name": "Krita"}}]},
    {"name": "an edit beats the preset, an older edit loses, a newer one wins through an alias", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Krita mine", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Krita mine"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Krita old", "updatedAt": "2026-04-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 1, "name": "Krita mine"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Krita same time", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 1, "name": "Krita mine"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "krita.exe", "aliases": ["org.krita"], "name": "Krita new", "updatedAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.5Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 2, "name": "Krita new"}}], "storedNames": ["Krita new"]},
    {"name": "an unedited preset is not stored", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsertPreset", "preset": "krita", "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 0, "name": "Krita"}}], "storedNames": []},
    {"name": "imports (dated just after the presets) replace a preset but never an edit", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "name": "Imported PS", "updatedAt": "2000-01-02T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Imported PS"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Edited Krita", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 2, "name": "Edited Krita"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Imported Krita", "updatedAt": "2000-01-02T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 2, "name": "Edited Krita"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.seriflabs.affinityphoto2", "name": "Undated copy", "updatedAt": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "stale", "changed": false, "revision": 2, "name": "Affinity Photo 2"}}], "storedNames": ["Imported PS", "Edited Krita"]},
    {"name": "delete brings the preset back; deleting an app without a preset reports deleted", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "name": "Mine", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Mine"}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 2, "revealedPreset": "photoshop", "sendSnapshot": true, "name": "Adobe Photoshop"}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "expect": {"removed": false, "revision": 2, "revealedPreset": null, "sendSnapshot": false, "name": "Adobe Photoshop"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.apple.TextEdit", "name": "TextEdit", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 3, "name": "TextEdit"}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "com.apple.TextEdit", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 4, "revealedPreset": null, "sendSnapshot": false, "deleted": "com.apple.TextEdit"}}], "storedNames": []},
    {"name": "the * profile", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "*", "name": "My default", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "My default"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "com.apple.TextEdit", "expect": {"name": "My default"}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "expect": {"preset": "photoshop"}}, {"op": "delete", "appKey": "*", "expect": {"removed": true, "revision": 2, "revealedPreset": "default", "sendSnapshot": true, "name": "All other apps"}}], "storedNames": []},
    {"name": "invalid profiles are kept out", "presets": "builtin", "source": "PadMac", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 2, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Future", "updatedAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "invalid", "changed": false, "revision": 0, "name": "Krita"}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "  ", "name": "Blank", "updatedAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "invalid", "changed": false, "revision": 0, "deleted": "  "}}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.example.app", "name": "Undated", "updatedAt": "yesterday", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "invalid", "changed": false, "revision": 0, "deleted": "com.example.app"}, "note": "PadMac stored an undated profile; the schema's date-time format and PadWin refuse it"}, {"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.example.app", "name": "Dated", "updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Dated"}}], "storedNames": ["Dated"]},
    {"name": "first-connect import never overwrites", "presets": "builtin", "source": "core", "steps": [{"op": "upsert", "profile": {"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Edited", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, "expect": {"result": "accepted", "changed": true, "revision": 1, "name": "Edited"}}, {"op": "import", "profiles": [{"schema": 1, "appKey": "org.krita", "name": "Imported Krita", "updatedAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.apple.TextEdit", "name": "TextEdit", "updatedAt": "2000-01-02T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}, {"schema": 1, "appKey": "com.adobe.Photoshop", "name": "Old copy", "updatedAt": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z", "groups": []}], "expect": {"names": ["TextEdit"], "revision": 2}}, {"op": "forApp", "appKey": "org.krita", "expect": {"name": "Edited"}}], "storedNames": ["Edited", "TextEdit"]}
  ]
}
